reviews.text:
Live and playback cut out have to hard close app to do anything now. So disappointing. 4 cameras basically useless

Update November 2026;

This review didn’t age well. I bought 2 more cameras to replace 2/4 since. Got a doorbell camera. Paid for the cloud storage. At least that one was doing well for a year…..or so I thought. Now it’s basically there for decoration. No event recording on sd card or cloud for the last week. No motion warning. Doorbell sound outside stopped too. Talked to customer service. The rep was very nice and tried everything short of me removing the doorbell and factory resetting since I literally cannot do it. Now I just have to wait for the backend team to maybe work some magic and get it working. Disappointing. I really wanted to love these cameras but maybe I was better off going with Telus home security.
